      <h2 class="section-title section-title-glow">About Steve J. Ngoumnai</h2>
      <p>Steve J. Ngoumnai is the founder of Askia and a former engineering leader who spent years on the hiring side — reviewing thousands of resumes, conducting executive interviews, and making comp decisions across roles from $80K individual contributors to $300K+ senior leaders in tech and healthcare.</p>
      <p>After leaving his engineering leadership role, Steve founded Askia to bring hiring-side expertise to job seekers. He coaches Directors, VPs, C-suite leaders, and senior individual contributors targeting $100K–$350K roles in tech, finance, and healthcare.</p>
      <p>Askia is headquartered in Houston, TX and serves clients remotely across the United States.</p>
    </div>
